Good morning,

The points I've made in my appeal application have serious
ramifications for the original application for Variance made by Thorwin
Properties and I request that my submission be put through regardless of my
status as a tenant and non-property owner. =E2=80=9CAny decision by a desig=
nated
employee or a planning commission on an application for a variance may be
appealed in accordance with section 189 (appeals) by:



(a)          the applicant;

(b)          the owner of real property adjacent to the real property in
respect of which the application was made;

or

(c)           any person who made submissions at any hearing conducted in
respect of the application.=E2=80=9D

Please provide me with alternatives if you are unable to deem me eligible.

Thank you,
Evan Rosner


